---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
import Breadcrumbs from '../components/Breadcrumbs.astro';
---

<Layout title="About — platte.dev">
  <Breadcrumbs parts={[{ label: '~', href: '/' }, { label: 'about' }]} />
  <div class="mx-auto mt-[18px] max-w-[var(--max-page)] px-6">
    <h1 class="my-[18px] mb-3.5 font-serif text-[48px] font-normal tracking-[-0.02em]">About</h1>

    <div class="prose">
      <p class="lede">
        I'm Platte, a senior backend engineer at HubSpot, based in
        Lincoln, Nebraska. I work primarily on backend systems at work;
        on personal projects I tend to reach for Svelte, Elixir, and
        Cloudflare.
      </p>
      <p>
        What I actually care about in engineering is mostly leverage.
        Code that's maintainable enough to come back to without dread.
        Using AI tools seriously, as a real part of how I work rather
        than a novelty. Being a teammate who makes the people around
        them more effective. Thinking like a product person, not just
        an implementer. And, less glamorously: not shipping bugs.
      </p>
      <p>
        Outside of work, I live in Lincoln with my wife and our two
        young kids. Most of my time goes to them. What's left tends to
        land on:
      </p>
      <ul>
        <li>Guitar, and an ongoing interest in pedals and gear culture.</li>
        <li>Chess, mostly on Lichess.</li>
        <li>D&amp;D — long campaigns, character voices, the whole thing.</li>
        <li>Writing fiction, slowly.</li>
      </ul>
    </div>
  </div>
</Layout>
